From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] crypt32: CryptSet/Get/EnumKeyIdentifierProperty(ies)

Properties attached to a key identifier, kept per user (HKCU) or per machine (CRYPT_KEYID_MACHINE_FLAG, HKLM) under Software\Microsoft\SystemCertificates\KeyId\Keys\<hex id>, value Blob, serialized as a store serializes certificate properties (CERT_KEY_PROV_INFO_PROP_ID in its offset form). Set handles NULL (remove), CRYPT_KEYID_DELETE_FLAG and CRYPT_KEYID_SET_NEW_FLAG; Get returns CRYPT_KEY_PROV_INFO self-contained in the caller's buffer or with CRYPT_KEYID_ALLOC_FLAG; Enum walks all key ids or one, all properties or one. Set was a stub; Get and Enum were not exported. wincrypt.h gains the declarations and flags.
---
--- a/dlls/crypt32/cert.c
+++ b/dlls/crypt32/cert.c
@@ -4491,6 +4491,7 @@
     }
 }
 
